  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scholarship Program for Primary Education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is intends to provide scholarships to students from grade 4 to 6 to improve their school attendance and academic performance. The funds will be used in supporting not only their studies but also their families by providing financial assistance for business advancement. By integrating the families into our Income Generation Program, as into community Savings Groups and Farmer Field Schools, we hope to sustain the family&apos;s financial stability, hence supporting the students&apos; long-term education. Over time, we anticipate an enhanced primary school completion rate, 
better lives for children and their families, and healthier communities.</narrative>
  </description>
